ス・パーマー　(Louis Palmer)\n性別：男\n年：17歳\n職業：学生\n身長：175センチ前後\n——\n②\n名：ヨシュア = S・イリアス　（Yoshua = Seth・Elias）\n性別：男\n年：38歳（外見年齢は14~17歳）\n職業：無職（研究所所長→死刑囚）\n身長：152センチ\n———\n添付のURLにキャラクターデザインや詳細情報などをまとめてあります。  \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1PdSherXc0VL4bViDnsrlRSqRQTxdoFQT?usp=drive_link\n\nご検討のほどよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@ikkin_yuiki/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3583739, "client_id": 2589213, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb2c288cdab24cacd39045ae36c8b592", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eb2c288cdab24cacd39045ae36c8b592, https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2d91e942af0db7e0b7f989ed3f1da19 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f776af0f076a87b1ea384029a489a33 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=916417a31fe523ee4476131011b7d098", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=916417a31fe523ee4476131011b7d098, https://si.imgix.net/3cf721d8/uploads/origins/c0085f82-de02-4549-bb02-f26c691b3837?bg